nk — Q1 FY27 (results 18 Jul 2026; stock -2% on print) Profit growth looks strong but is provision-led, and NIM compression is the market's worry — hence the negative stock reaction despite a 26% PAT jump. Profit &amp; margin. Standalone PAT Rs 4,123 cr (+26% YoY). NII Rs 7,928 cr (+9% YoY). NIM 4.53% — down from 4.65% YoY and 4.67% QoQ, the key drag. Provisions fell 45% YoY to Rs","doc_kind":"concall","kind":"written summary"},{"field":"improved","statement":"The bank's profit after tax increased by 26% year-on-year to 4,123 crore rupees in Q1 FY27.","quote":"PBT 5,463 4,356 5,339 25% 2% Provision For Tax 1,340 1,074 1,312 25% 2% PAT 4,123 3,282 4,027 26% 2%","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/KMBLTAB_18072026125020_InvestorPresentationJuly182026signed.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Net interest margin compressed to 4.53% in Q1 FY27 from 4.65% in Q1 FY26 and 4.67% in Q4 FY26.","quote":"Profitability NIM 4.53% 4.65% 4.67% Cost of Funds 4.46% 5.01% 4.45% Return on Equity 11.98% 10.94% 12.27% Return on Assets 2.14% 1.94% 2.14%","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/KMBLTAB_18072026125020_InvestorPresentationJuly182026signed.pdf","page":13.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Employee expenses for the quarter reflected an adverse impact of approximately 100 crore rupees in retirement benefits caused by shifts in discount rates.","quote":"Q1FY27: Employee cost includes hit in retiral benefits due to movement in discount rates: ~ ₹ 100 cr (Q4FY26: reversal of ~ ₹ 100 cr)","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/KMBLTAB_18072026125020_InvestorPresentationJuly182026signed.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"Kotak Securities rolled out Scalper Pro, an advanced trading terminal equipped with multi-chart analysis and single-click execution for high-frequency trading.","qu